  "details": "A feature that I think would be well received for VRC+ is increased voice quality.\nDiscord utilizes such a feature with their nitro program----namely, anyone utilizing nitro has a higher bitrate for their voice calls; this enhances quality as there's less compression artifacts and it results in a naturally clearer voice.\nVRC+ users being able to speak with greater clarity would be a subtle, but meaningful boost.\nHaving the ability to toggle it off, however, would be appreciated, especially for the low bandwidth users who may not be able to utilize higher bitrates.",
